        "config": {
          "text": "Demo: while Demo is on, a Clock plays a note every half beat so you can hear the patch without a keyboard (and so `audioc render` has something to play). For a real melody, swap it for a MIDI Pattern node and draw the notes in its piano roll. Turn Demo off to play only from MIDI."
